          "Description 1": "ANTONY came to us with a more bold mission to break away from their generic visual identity and truly represent their creative firepower. As a growing design agency, they had the talent and work but lacked a cohesive, ownable brand. Their logo felt outdated, their colors muted, and their tone unclear. They needed more than a facelift \u2014 they needed a system that could grow with them, resonate with a modern audience, and establish their voice in a saturated market.\n",
