          "Heading 1": "INTRODUCTION",
          "Description 1": "SOTTO needed more than just a redesign \u2014 they needed a reintroduction. As a boutique agency with premium clients, their previous digital presence didn\u2019t match their refined, high-caliber work. They approached us to create a brand identity that exuded elegance, simplicity, and quiet confidence \u2014 the same values that define their approach to design.\n",
          "Heading 2": "DESIGNING METHOD",
          "Description 2": "Our strategy focused on minimalism with intent. We developed a layout system that felt luxurious in its restraint. Fewer elements, more breathing room. Neutral color tones balanced with precise typographic choices helped craft a visual tone that was both professional and personal. Micro-interactions were used sparingly but meaningfully to elevate the experience.\n",
          "Description 3": "Photography and case visuals were placed at the center \u2014 letting the work speak without distraction. The site structure was built with responsive components, ensuring the design maintained its grace across all screen sizes. Every design decision reinforced clarity, precision, and a refined aesthetic that aligned with SOTTO\u2019s brand ethos.\n",
