          "Heading 3": "FINAL PERFORMANCE",
          "Description 4": "Your logo should reflect the personality and positioning of your brand. A luxury fashion brand might opt for a minimalist wordmark with elegant spacing, while a tech startup could go for a bold, geometric symbol. Always consider your audience and message before finalizing direction. Logo design isn\u2019t just about aesthetics \u2014 it\u2019s about meaning. The most iconic logos in the world, from A to B, embody their brand\u2019s vision in a single mark. Start with purpose, keep it clean, and test it across real-world scenarios. A logo built on strategy and simplicity always wins.",
